{"agent_id":"pp3g-Y2aY-build-459-lifecycle-manager-sh-extend-the-liveness","agent_seq":4,"timestamp":"2026-08-24T07:07:05.974784402Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"530a3c9d-4178-4476-a672-d18669283b43","comment_uuid":"0ec8980e-cbc5-4165-ba44-a0a1fb6b300d","author":"pp3g-Y2aY-build-459-lifecycle-manager-sh-extend-the-liveness","content":"Plan: Build scripts/lifecycle-manager.sh as a bash wrapper (stdlib bash+python3 embedded) around agent-liveness.py v2 on the 120s cycle. Architecture: (1) per-cycle liveness scan --json --all; (2) transition refinement layer - PARKED override when STALE-SUSPECT/LIKELY-FROZEN coincides with AI_APICallError rate-limit signature in the agent's attributed opencode.log section (session-id attribution via cwd=worktree match); FAILED-vs-KILLED discrimination via tmux pane_dead_status (143/137=SIGTERM/SIGKILL -> KILLED, other nonzero -> FAILED); (3) six post-transition action sets per .design/lifecycle-manager-design.md: COMPLETED (kickoff cleanup --only --yes + deliverable branch check + model-evidence staging row), FINISHED-UNMARKABLE (findings-exist check on working issue parsed from KICKOFF.md + force-sweep flag file + evidence row), FAILED (preserve worktree + failure alert w/ log-tail evidence + backup-model relaunch rec), KILLED (immediate scoped cleanup + orphan verify + termination record), PARKED (resume_at from retry-after parse or default window, no kill, simultaneous-parked threshold alert), FROZEN (200-line log-tail evidence bundle + auto-kill per operator-granted spiral authority #443 rev3 via kickoff stop --force + cleanup + termination record w/ sha256 evidence chain + relaunch rec); STALE-SUSPECT one-warning-cycle then escalate to FROZEN path. (4) Wave-level: main HEAD change detection -> rev-list origin/main..main count > threshold -> copy-paste-ready push suggestion (#451 pattern); doctrine/knowledge content-hash snapshot (.crosslink/knowledge + docs/methodology + docs/standards + root canon) -> on edit, reverse-edge dependent lookup via frontmatter depends_on/related_documents/consumed_by -> built-in existence-validator (cited paths must resolve; LIFECYCLE_DIS_VALIDATOR env overrides with external DIS V1 when it lands). All state under /tmp/opencode/lifecycle-state/ (manager-state.json, events.jsonl, model-evidence-staging.jsonl, evidence/<agent>/). Anti-loop: once-per-episode dedup per (agent,action), global mutating-action circuit breaker, consecutive-error cycle cap. Testability: --once mode, DRY_RUN gating all mutations, LIFECYCLE_INPUT_JSON fixture injection to exercise all six verdicts against synthetic snapshots without touching live agents. All mutations exclusively via crosslink CLI surfaces.","created_at":"2026-08-24T07:07:05.964136087Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:myMRlDrE2bc+L3PLgBPdLLTwolyU/0LzjEla7UurROg","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgGY7n1/eQGHAmImTkI6/KAd1sveMz2gtzBcMuT6aO+eoAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABA9EJhxDp1/nWDIcprkITsQjzYKRbIuw/aYaUetCxN3nuHnmVfP/Av4RkO8aqgBm3nrYQh2raJIMdTG2OnBw7fAQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:myMRlDrE2bc+L3PLgBPdLLTwolyU/0LzjEla7UurROg","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgGY7n1/eQGHAmImTkI6/KAd1sveMz2gtzBcMuT6aO+eoAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLMtRte1XQ5QElf1/E6F3zLRGcb7YzxHidS+Ps33kC2o/enTYQy+9VXneWCv76SEPj1Qu0S7JyOrgnRYbjSc5wQ="}
